POST
/api/v1/auth/request-code
Send a web login code to the registered user's Telegram chat

Codes last 180 seconds. Resend after 60 seconds using this endpoint. Returns the same response for unknown numbers, blocked bots, and delivery failures. Limits: 5 sends per phone and 20 per IP in 15 minutes. No code is returned in the response.

Parameters
Try it out
No parameters

Request body

application/json
Example Value
Schema
{
  "data": {
    "phone_number": "+998901234567"
  }
}
