POST
/api/v1/auth/verify-code
Verify a Telegram code and create a web session without expiration

Accepts a code once, with at most 5 wrong attempts per code. Sets the HttpOnly qubnix_session cookie; the session has no server-side expiry. Use credentials: include in browser requests. Codes are strings, including leading zeroes.

Parameters
Try it out
No parameters

Request body

application/json
Example Value
Schema
{
  "data": {
    "verification_token": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
    "code": "048291"
  }
}
